    "text": "<div style=\"text-align:center; margin:1.2em 0; font-size:1.1em;\">5<i>G</i> + 45<i>R</i> = 380</div>At a school fair, students can win colored tokens that are worth a different number of points depending on the color. One student won <i>G</i> green tokens and <i>R</i> red tokens worth a total of 380 points. The given equation represents this situation. How many more points is a red token worth than a green token?",
